### Criar pedido
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Id: demo-123

{
  "customerId": "c1",
  "items": [
    { "sku": "SKU-1", "quantity": 2 },
    { "sku": "SKU-2", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

###

### Buscar pedido (cole o UUID retornado)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{orderId}}
X-Request-Id: demo-123

###

### Reprocessar pagamento
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{orderId}}/process
X-Request-Id: demo-123

###

### Ver estoque SKU-1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/stock/SKU-1
X-Request-Id: demo-123
